: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa conta com provas jovens a partir das 09:30, Caminhada de 4,5 km \u00e0s 09:45 e Prova Principal de 8,3 km \u00e0s 10:30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem s\u00e3o os padrinhos oficiais desta 22.\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova conta com o prest\u00edgio e apadrinhamento dos consagrados atletas Aurora Cunha e Bernardo Rocha.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tipo de percurso da prova principal?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso de 8,3 km \u00e9 totalmente em asfalto, desenhado pelas art\u00e9rias da vila e zona envolvente ao complexo termal.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso fazer a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma Lap2Go at\u00e9 